      {
        "text": "# Bias\n\n**Bias** happens when some people, ideas, or situations are represented more than others in a way that is unfair. \n\nIn data and AI, **bias** often comes from who is missing or who is overrepresented in the dataset an AI learns from.\n\nIf one group shows up much more than others, the AI’s view becomes uneven — some groups get extra attention while others are almost invisible.\n\n",
